  "solution": "Logic : (1st number × 3) + 2nd number = 3rd number\n\nGiven :\n\n__\n \n• (26, 62, 140)\n\n**(26 × 3)**__ + 62 = 140\n\n__**78 + 62**__ = 140\n\n140 = 140 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (12, 39, 75)\n\n(12 × 3)__ + 39 = 75\n\n__36 + 39__ = 75\n\n75 = 75 (LHS = RHS)\n\n​So,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (20, 38, 108)​\n\n(20 × 3)__ + 38 = 108\n\n__60 + 38__ = 108\n\n98 ≠ 108 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (20, 48, 108)​\n\n(20 × 3)__ + 48 = 108\n\n__60 + 48__ = 108\n\n**108 = 108 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (50, 48, 108)​\n\n(50 × 3)__ + 48 = 108\n\n__150 + 48__ = 108\n\n198 ≠ 108 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (20, 48, 98)​\n\n(20 × 3)__ + 48 = 98\n\n__60 + 48__ = 98\n\n108 ≠ 108 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.\n\n51:T1335",
